{
  "title": {
    "en": "Vault & Climb Anywhere",
    "zh-Hans": "随处翻越与攀爬"
  },
  "description": {
    "en": "Jump in front of an obstacle the game will not let you pass, and you vault over it or climb onto it, up to 5 m high, with the game's own animations. The settings pick the lowest and highest obstacles, leaning faces, railings the game leaves out, and the drop allowed behind.",
    "zh-Hans": "在游戏不允许通过的障碍物前跳跃，即可用游戏自带的动作翻越或攀上去，最高 5 米。可在设置中选择：最低和最高障碍、倾斜面、游戏忽略的栏杆，以及允许的后方落差。"
  },
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "settings": [
    {
      "key": "Enabled",
      "type": "toggle",
      "label": {
        "en": "Enabled",
        "zh-Hans": "启用"
      },
      "help": {
        "en": "Off: the mod does nothing and the game's own vaulting settings come back. An action under way ends normally.",
        "zh-Hans": "关闭：模组不再生效，游戏自带的翻越设置恢复原样。正在进行的动作会正常结束。"
      },
      "default": true
    },
