    {
      "key": "ClimbLeaning",
      "type": "toggle",
      "label": {
        "en": "Climb leaning faces",
        "zh-Hans": "攀爬倾斜面"
      },
      "help": {
        "en": "Rocks and walls that lean back, up to about 30° from upright, are climbed up to their real top. Off: upright faces only.",
        "zh-Hans": "向后倾斜不超过约 30° 的岩石和墙面可一直攀到真正的顶部。关闭：只攀爬竖直面。"
      },
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "key": "EyeObstacles",
      "type": "toggle",
      "label": {
        "en": "Obstacles the game leaves out",
        "zh-Hans": "游戏忽略的障碍"
      },
      "help": {
        "en": "Also vault over and climb what the game's own vaulting ignores, such as railings and shelves. Off: only what the game marks as an obstacle.",
        "zh-Hans": "还会翻越和攀爬游戏自带翻越所忽略的物体，例如栏杆和架子。关闭：只处理游戏标记为障碍的物体。"
      },
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "key": "DropLimit",
      "type": "toggle",
      "label": {
        "en": "Limit the drop behind",
        "zh-Hans": "限制后方落差"
      },
      "help": {
        "en": "On: the mod does not vault you over a railing with a drop behind deeper than the next setting; it climbs onto it when its top is wide enough. The game's own vaulting keeps its own rule. Off: the mod vaults whatever the drop. Fall damage stays the game's.",
        "zh-Hans": "开启：模组不会翻越后方落差超过下一项设置的栏杆；若顶部足够宽，会攀上去。游戏自带的翻越保持其自身规则。关闭：模组无论落差多深都会翻越。坠落伤害仍由游戏决定。"
      },
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "key": "MaxDropBehind",
      "type": "choice",
      "slider": true,
      "label": {
        "en": "Deepest drop behind (m)",
        "zh-Hans": "最大后方落差（米）"
      },
      "help": {
        "en": "With the limit on: the deepest drop behind an obstacle that you still vault over.",
        "zh-Hans": "开启限制时：仍会翻越的障碍物后方的最大落差。"
      },
